Blood Truths#Outcome & Continuity#{2}":[57,57],"#Heirloom Vows and Blood Truths#Outcome & Continuity#{3}":[58,58],"#Heirloom Vows and Blood Truths#Outcome & Continuity#{4}":[59,59],"#Heirloom Vows and Blood Truths#Outcome & Continuity#{5}":[60,60],"#Heirloom Vows and Blood Truths#Outcome & Continuity#{6}":[61,61],"#Heirloom Vows and Blood Truths#Outcome & Continuity#{7}":[62,62],"#Heirloom Vows and Blood Truths#Outcome & Continuity#{8}":[63,63]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["triad union","grandmother's gold bands","binding vows","Mistress protocol","silk cord restraints","Ryan Claymore-Adame","suicide attempt confession","covert doublespeak code","sisters' sworn oaths","Wedding security delegation"],"position":"after","depth":4,"summary":"Friday, June 16, 1843, 11:00 AM to 1:50 PM. A triad union ceremony where the new husband, Ryan, is formally integrated into his wives' protective network. Select when establishing the marriage's legitimacy, integrating a new partner into a secret family unit, or revealing a hidden identity (the Duran Prince) using a doublespeak code. Key relationships: Ryan (submissive partner), Charlotte (dominant protector), and Mina/Cora (military guardians)."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Flora - Memory Books/Arcs/[ARC 008] - Heirloom Vows and Blood Truths.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"unuin6","at":1777331817923},"key":"Flora - Memory Books/Arcs/[ARC 008] - Heirloom Vows and Blood Truths.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,21],"size":806,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
